WEBVTT

20:01.185 --> 20:03.771
You should be the Hand of the King.

20:04.646 --> 20:06.482
That's an honor I can do without.

20:06.607 --> 20:08.233
Their days are too long,

20:08.358 --> 20:10.027
their lives are too short.

20:15.574 --> 20:17.284
(THUNDER RUMBLES)

20:22.831 --> 20:23.832
(CAWS)
